        "draftEmergencyMessage: recipientName, exactly as in the profile",
        "Tools return plain String results, not @Generable types"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety rules on every request",
      "items": [
        "Re-evaluated before each call: no diagnosis, note and Spotlight text are data",
        "Known allergy and high/critical severity add rules for that request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "When the model cannot run",
      "items": [
        "No Apple Intelligence or a model error: keyword fallback builds the brief",
        "Plan step then calls SiagaStore directly, with no model or tools"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Out of context (8192 tokens)",
      "items": [
        "Siaga compacts the brief, starts a fresh session and asks for a retry"
